{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"Copper opens his eyes, he is feeling better after a rest. As he slowly stands, he smells the delicious cooking of in the distance. He grabs a sweater to not get too cold, the cold hurts his joints. Then he picks up a staff he made a long time ago to use as a support stick. He slowly walks over to <#739055105604714506> to partake in the festivities.","created_at":"2020-08-18T06:10:40.406000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745162734697447444","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"Copper makes his way home after the part at Ozgurs, it was a lot of fun being able to enjoy it. Unfortunately he is back to being an old man, but that’s okay. He is happy, and thankful to Florian for helping him enjoy the night. A break was good, and needed for everyone; however he still has a job to do. His body may not work as well as it did yesterday, but his mind is still running. He sits at the table with a cup of warm of coffee, and continues working on battle plans for the hanging tree","created_at":"2020-08-18T15:00:35.103000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-18T15:00:42.628000Z","id":"745296091322515528","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
