{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"Copper let’s out a sigh of relief that Wynne is okay","created_at":"2020-08-18T19:12:33.313000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745359501691191366","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"\"Glyph of warding... generally people use it to prepare mines of sorts... well spells can also be binded to it. What if I made a bunch within the Hallow area that can cast cure wounds on our allies?\"","created_at":"2020-08-18T19:13:31.493000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745359745715535962","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"Copper slowly nods “I was thinking of Glyph too, but not in that sense. That is very smart.”","created_at":"2020-08-18T19:14:40.870000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745360036704026796","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"They nod. “A solid plan.”","created_at":"2020-08-18T19:15:03.408000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745360131235119114","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"\"I think keeping people up and fighting will be just as beneficial as trying to take it down. I've decided I should probably fight at range during the fight so I can help support people.\"","created_at":"2020-08-18T19:17:03.813000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-18T19:17:19.658000Z","id":"745360636250161262","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"“I think you should be in charge of the healing preparations, Lilia. We should organize into squadrons. Healers, support, melee, ranged.”","created_at":"2020-08-18T19:18:36.737000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745361026001797172","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"She nods","created_at":"2020-08-18T19:19:08.287000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745361158332088331","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"“Support should be people who are adept at both melee and ranged attacks, and healers. Melee should be paladins, fighters, monks... Ranged should be our marksmen and offensive spellcasters.”","created_at":"2020-08-18T19:20:56.845000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745361613657473126","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"Copper nods slowly, “i think that that is a good idea. It would allow each group to focus on what they do best.”","created_at":"2020-08-18T19:22:21.180000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745361967384100967","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"\"Thankfully I can go wherever I'm needed, be it on the front lines or at a distance. I do think making glyph to heal people will help me stay closer to the front though.\"","created_at":"2020-08-18T19:23:50.003000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745362339934503045","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"“We should also have leaders of the squads. To make important calls if needed and to help with communication.”","created_at":"2020-08-18T19:24:19.644000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-18T19:24:31.191000Z","id":"745362464257998959","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"They nod in agreement with Lilia.","created_at":"2020-08-18T19:24:39.470000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745362547414269992","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"Copper says softly, “Healing is something that we do lack. Because we only have a few healers, who than have to choose between healing or fighting, those glyphs can help turn the tide of battle”","created_at":"2020-08-18T19:25:53.456000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745362857733914774","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"\"Setting up teams will requre a lot of work.. making sure each group is balanced and willing to listen to their appointed leader.\"","created_at":"2020-08-18T19:26:08.504000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745362920849932389","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"They nod. “Healing preparations will be needed. I am going to commission Skitter for as many healing potions as he can make. But I do think having teams will help, especially for planning before the fight. Of course, things always happen on the battlefield. I don’t expect our town to be an organized military, but having a smaller team to account for helps reduce chaos.”","created_at":"2020-08-18T19:32:11.997000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745364445450076281","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"\"I will work on the healing glyphs tomorrow, when I can prepare the spells.\"","created_at":"2020-08-18T19:33:41.194000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745364819569279141","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"Copper slowly nods, “and if we can prepare the battlefield, we could set it up to be a huge advantage to use to slow down the enemies. And hopefully stop some of them if we are lucky.”","created_at":"2020-08-18T19:34:06.715000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745364926612111410","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
